      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0011,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "那这一座古庙喊什么名字呢？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 8.181,
      "end": 12.026,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这座古庙也有点什么好耍好听的版路呢？",
      "score": 0.0938,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1125,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.118,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "耍",
        "text_free": "这座古庙又有点什么好耍、好听的伴路呢？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 12.601,
      "end": 15.515,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "古时候人们起房子、建有讲究，",
      "score": 0.6343,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -2.802,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.25,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "古时候，营门起房子蛮有讲究。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 15.66,
      "end": 18.413,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "要先搞一番堪舆之术，",
      "score": 0.2755,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.4234,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.076,
        "seg_cer": 0.333,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.333,
        "phon_examples": "之/子",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "要先搞一番探鱼子术。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 18.413,
      "end": 21.388,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "也就是我们平时讲的看风水，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1275,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "也就是我们平时讲的看风水。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 21.727,
      "end": 24.411,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "再根据地形地势来建设。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.014,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "再根据地形地势来建设。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 24.671,
      "end": 30.333,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "村里头的这一座古庙恰好处在村口的一个山岔路口旁边，",
      "score": 0.151,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.3199,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.011,
        "seg_cer": 0.208,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.2,
        "phon_examples": "山/三",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "城里头的这一座古庙，括号处在城口的一个三岔路口旁边。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 30.637,
      "end": 33.877,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "建的时候就考虑到了风水的问题。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0118,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "建的时候就考虑到了风水的问题。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 34.381,
      "end": 37.37,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这个庙以前喊做什么庙？以前呢，",
      "score": 0.146,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.4257,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.078,
        "seg_cer": 0.231,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这个庙以前还都什么庙？以前的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 37.37,
      "end": 40.297,
      "label": "uncertain",
      "text": "喊做这个我几大的时候，",
      "score": 0.3888,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.9976,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.44,
        "seg_cer": 0.4,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "看着这个，我遇到的时候。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 40.297,
      "end": 43.48,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这个庙呢都是叫做小庙。叫小庙？",
      "score": 0.3285,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.0867,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.496,
        "seg_cer": 0.154,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这个庙呢，都是叫做小庙，全是小庙。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 43.48,
      "end": 47.309,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "嗯。那意思讲，在我们这个阳梅里有一个大庙了。",
      "score": 0.1844,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.243,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.316,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "咯",
        "text_free": "那意思讲，在我们这个阳明里，应该有个大庙咯。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 47.309,
      "end": 51.559,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "大庙有。有。大庙是在东门大岸头那个地方。",
      "score": 0.0538,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2833,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.118,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "大庙有，大庙是在龙门大岸头那个地方。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 51.559,
      "end": 53.729,
      "label": "uncertain",
      "text": "哦。我们那边大那个地方，",
      "score": 0.4371,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.1442,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.533,
        "seg_cer": 0.5,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "哦，我们慢慢就到那个地方去。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 53.729,
      "end": 56.722,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "啊，这样小庙呢可能说保存好一点的吧。",
      "score": 0.276,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.655,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.223,
        "seg_cer": 0.375,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "啊，这种小苗呢，可能是保育成的好一点的吧。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 56.722,
      "end": 60.219,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "好，这个小庙的目的一个是",
      "score": 0.1882,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.4955,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.122,
        "seg_cer": 0.273,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "哦，这个巧妙的目的，一个是。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 60.725,
      "end": 63.98,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这个地边有一个这个风口吹过来，",
      "score": 0.3659,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.2156,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.578,
        "seg_cer": 0.143,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这个这边有一个这个风口吹过大。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 63.98,
      "end": 67.098,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "嗯，要庙的当中的一个就是地部分。",
      "score": 0.68,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -2.009,
